### Bug Analysis

**Bug Scenario Description:**
The image shows an accordion component with chevrons aligned to the start of the heading. The bug report indicates a need to add an `align` prop to the `AccordionItem` component to allow chevrons to be aligned either at the start or end of the heading.

**Root Cause:**
The current implementation of the `AccordionItem` component does not support an `align` prop to control the alignment of the chevron. The chevron is always aligned to the start, which is not configurable.

